sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Q as QA 操作者
  participant TD as test-deploy.sh
  participant W as 包装脚本
  participant RH as 假 Vercel(stub)
  participant BR as slot Bridge
  participant CLI as publish-report
  participant DC as Discord 529 频道
  Q->>TD: 在 runner 环境直接运行(不改 env)
  TD->>TD: 铸 slot token,固定 TMPDIR
  TD->>W: 按 launch spec 启动(env -u VERCEL_TOKEN 后再注入 slot 的)
  W->>RH: 起 stub(env -i)
  RH-->>W: 自探活成功,写 port
  W->>BR: 导出 OVERRIDE_URL,exec(同一个进程号)
  BR-->>TD: /health 200,日志「report host override active (QA only)」
  TD-->>Q: JSON:reportHost.url、apiTokenPath、验收配方
  Q->>CLI: publish-report --html … --channel <slot 频道>
  CLI->>BR: POST /api/reports/publish
  BR->>RH: POST /v13/deployments(Bearer slot token)
  RH-->>BR: id、readyState READY
  BR-->>CLI: url = http://127.0.0.1:端口/<name>/r/<token>/
  CLI->>RH: 截图打开该 URL(失败可降级为纯链接)
  CLI->>BR: POST /api/reports/deliver
  BR->>DC: 一条消息(截图 + 链接)
  Q->>Q: 负向对照:~/.flywheel/reports 的 registry.json mtime、previews 计数不变
  Q->>BR: teardown(既有 Step 5 杀 Bridge)
  RH->>RH: 父进程没了,500 毫秒内自退
